# PCBDCOM.CFG — pcbdcom v1 port configuration
# Format: PORT CARD SUBPORT BASE IRQ CARDSEG FOSSIL
# Card types: 8250 BOCA BOCA16 CYCLOM DIGI_PCXE DIGI_ACCEL ROCKET EASYIO
# Base: I/O port (hex OK: 0x3F8), IRQ: 3..15, CardSeg: 0 for I/O-mapped,
# non-zero for memory-mapped smart cards (Cyclom, Digi). FOSSIL: Y or N.

# Standard COM1..COM4 —
  1  8250   0  0x3F8  4  0  Y
  2  8250   0  0x2F8  3  0  Y

# Example Boca BB-1008 at 0x100, IRQ 5 (uncomment to use):
#  3  BOCA   0  0x100  5  0  Y
#  4  BOCA   1  0x108  5  0  Y
#  5  BOCA   2  0x110  5  0  Y
#  6  BOCA   3  0x118  5  0  Y
#  7  BOCA   4  0x120  5  0  Y
#  8  BOCA   5  0x128  5  0  Y
#  9  BOCA   6  0x130  5  0  Y
# 10  BOCA   7  0x138  5  0  Y

# Example Cyclades Cyclom-4Y at CardSeg D000, IRQ 10:
# 11  CYCLOM 0  0      10 0xD000  Y
# 12  CYCLOM 1  0      10 0xD000  Y
# 13  CYCLOM 2  0      10 0xD000  Y
# 14  CYCLOM 3  0      10 0xD000  Y
